{"name": "Eagle Knight Paradox", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect the city or risk it all for those you love?</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/4889f1609e76932bf7a2be6cdfb4148e.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/4889f1609e76932bf7a2be6cdfb4148e.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/4889f1609e76932bf7a2be6cdfb4148e.mp4?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Comala 88 is a neon-lit city still carrying the scars of war, and you're the one thing standing between it and the dark. By day, live as Ian: walk the streets, forge bonds, and witness how those scars ripple through everyday life. By night, climb into your towering combat mecha and face colossal enemies in frantic, skill-based battles. Every choice you make shapes what's left of the city, and who's still in it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>High-speed mecha combat that hits hard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/d1f16db1bfabd5a99e73c9deb984e8a5.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/d1f16db1bfabd5a99e73c9deb984e8a5.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/d1f16db1bfabd5a99e73c9deb984e8a5.mp4?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Colossal enemies. Split-second timing. Suit up and go save Comala 88.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A cyberpunk graphic novel with real consequences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/9df4f480b6cbb42d09cb1e0b57d13c21.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/9df4f480b6cbb42d09cb1e0b57d13c21.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/9df4f480b6cbb42d09cb1e0b57d13c21.mp4?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore Comala 88's streets and murals, and meet its residents. Every conversation, every decision changes what's waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ian: a boy by day, a hero by night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/868c687b8c420d187f20f4386ddfa954.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/868c687b8c420d187f20f4386ddfa954.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/868c687b8c420d187f20f4386ddfa954.mp4?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/38698061786017f4d3145fdfb90809cd.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/38698061786017f4d3145fdfb90809cd.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A boy with the lost dream of becoming an Eagle Knight pilot. Now, Comala 88 is offering him something he thought was gone for good. Today, he's the only one standing between the city and the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A city of rivals, legends, and unlikely allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/284498c9b78d5b50df0211d89bb82061.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/284498c9b78d5b50df0211d89bb82061.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ian won't go throught this journey alone. Captain Rojas, a young commander of a legendary frigate with much to prove, takes a risk supporting Ian. Kaitlyn, his closest friend since childhood, has now a shocking new role that will make Ian question everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A hand-drawn story, told in about two hours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/ca4ec38f6c9de97fe08632c6b85230bb.poster.avif?t=1787835431\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/extras/ca4ec38f6c9de97fe08632c6b85230bb.webm?t=1787835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A story created and hand drawn frame by frame by a solo artist, crafted alongside a small team who channeled their love for games into every scene. No filler, nothing extra, just every scene made to count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Eagle Knight Paradox is a story-driven action-adventure that blends high-speed mecha battles with slice-of-life exploration. Step into the neon-lit city of Comala 88, where every choice you make will shape not only the fate of the city but also the lives of the people you meet.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008700/c1ea4b2f96a10e0b28d89e98e33a3fde6752a4f2/header.jpg?t=1787835431", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Pixel Graphics", "Story Rich", "Mechs", "Action", "Cyberpunk", "Visual Novel"], "developers": "Playstorm Studios", "publishers": "Playstorm Studios", "release_date": "Sep 21, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3008700", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 December 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/afOgvd8R_AQ", "first_seen": 1765238400.0, "review_rank": 1395}